# Web Dev Stack — Stremeline Associates

## Stack Summary

| Layer | Choice |
|-------|--------|
| **Runtime** | Node >= 18 |
| **Package manager** | pnpm 9 (workspaces) |
| **Build / tasks** | Turbo (monorepo) |
| **Web app** | Next.js 16 (App Router), React 19 |
| **Language** | TypeScript 5.9 (strict) |
| **Styling** | Tailwind CSS v4 (CSS-based config, no tailwind.config.js) |
| **Animation** | Motion (Framer Motion), GSAP + ScrollTrigger |
| **Smooth scroll** | Lenis |
| **UI components** | shadcn/ui (base), Aceternity UI (hero/visual), Magic UI (animated data) |
| **3D / WebGL** | React Three Fiber + Drei (hero particles/globe) |
| **Forms** | React Hook Form + Zod |
| **Email** | Resend + React Email |
| **Lint / format** | ESLint 9 (flat config), Prettier |
| **Shared packages** | @repo/ui, @repo/tokens, @repo/types, @repo/utils, @repo/validation, @repo/content, @repo/eslint-config, @repo/typescript-config |

## Monorepo Layout

```
apps/
  web/          # Main Next.js 16 app (App Router)
packages/
  ui/           # Shared React components (@repo/ui)
  tokens/       # Design tokens — colors, spacing, typography (@repo/tokens)
  types/        # Shared TypeScript types (@repo/types)
  utils/        # Utility functions like cn() (@repo/utils)
  validation/   # Zod schemas for forms (@repo/validation)
  content/      # Static content — services, case studies, team (@repo/content)
  eslint-config/
  typescript-config/
```

## Key Conventions

### Next.js (App Router)
- Server Components by default; add `"use client"` only for hooks/interactivity.
- Pages in `app/` directory: `page.tsx`, `layout.tsx`, `loading.tsx`, `error.tsx`.
- Route handlers under `app/api/`.

### Styling (Tailwind v4)
- Config lives in CSS (`@import "tailwindcss"` in globals.css), NOT in tailwind.config.js.
- PostCSS plugin: `@tailwindcss/postcss`.
- Use `cn()` from `@repo/utils` to merge Tailwind classes.

### Animation Hierarchy
- **Motion (Framer Motion)**: Component-level animations (enter/exit, hover, gestures).
- **GSAP + ScrollTrigger**: Scroll-driven section animations, parallax, pinning, timelines.
- **Lenis**: Global smooth scrolling wrapper — integrates with GSAP ScrollTrigger.
- **Aceternity UI**: Copy-paste animated hero/background components (aurora, beams, spotlight, text effects).
- **Magic UI**: Copy-paste animated data components (number ticker, marquee, bento grid, animated beam, orbit).

### Component Sources
- **shadcn/ui** components go in `components/ui/`.
- **Magic UI** components go in `components/magicui/`.
- **Aceternity UI** components go in `components/aceternity/`.
- Custom components go in `components/`.

### TypeScript
- Strict typing — no `any` unless justified.
- Shared types in `@repo/types`, imported across apps and packages.
- Run `pnpm check-types` from root.

### Forms & Validation
- Schemas defined in `@repo/validation` using Zod.
- Forms built with React Hook Form + `@hookform/resolvers/zod`.

## Quick Commands

- `pnpm dev` — Start all apps (web on port 3000)
- `pnpm build` — Build everything via Turbo
- `pnpm lint` — Lint all projects (zero warnings policy)
- `pnpm format` — Format with Prettier
- `pnpm check-types` — Typecheck all projects
- `pnpm add <pkg> -F web` — Add dep to web app
